g $A019 Flags: Parser
D $A019 Cleared by the command parser.
. Read by #R$A296, #R$C129, #R$C2BA and #R$D6C1.
  $A019,$02

g $A01B Flags: Initialised
D $A01B Cleared with #R$D6B8 at the game entry point.
. Read by #R$A040, #R$AAC4, #R$AAD1, #R$ACFB, #R$AD57, #R$AFE8, #R$B5B6, #R$D6C1 and #R$D99E.
B $A01B,$01

g $A01C Flags: Display
D $A01C Display flag.
. Read by #R$B191, #R$B517, #R$B936, #R$D6C1 and #R$D85B.
B $A01C,$01

