. Read by #R$A2BD, #R$A2E4, #R$A37D, #R$B191, #R$B387, #R$B405, #R$B4C1, #R$B568, #R$C493,
. #R$C4B2, #R$C4D1 and #R$C542.
B $A01D,$01

g $A01E Flags: Display
D $A01E Display flag.
. Read by #R$A2BD, #R$A37D, #R$B191, #R$B405, #R$C493 and #R$C4B2.
B $A01E,$01

