. Control code #N$03 in the table at #R$A55D.
.
. Used by the routine at #R$A5C3.
  $A702,$04 Read the parser.
  $A706,$02,b$01 Reset the zero flag, with the parser workspace in #REGde.
  $A708,$01 Return.

