.
. Used by the routine at #R$A5C3.
  $A709,$03 Call #R$A66C to fetch the next token.
  $A70C,$03 Call #R$A80E to print the token.
  $A70F,$01 Clear #REGa.
  $A710,$01 Return.

c $A711 Run A Text Token Entry
@ $A711 label=RunTextTokenEntry
D $A711 Fetches the next token and calls #R$BF1C with that token as the record, then
. restores the caller's record and returns zero.
.
. Control code #N$05 in the table at #R$A55D.
.
. Used by the routine at #R$A5C3.
  $A711,$05 Keep the record and call #R$A66C to fetch the next token.
  $A716,$03 Move the token into #REGix.
  $A719,$03 Call #R$BF1C with the token as the record.
  $A71C,$02 Restore the caller's record from the stack.
  $A71E,$01 Clear #REGa.
  $A71F,$01 Return.

