B $EAF6,$02 Display record read by #R$C9BF: flags #N$07, value #N$07.

c $EAF8 Copy The Character Onto Both Records
@ $EAF8 label=CopyCharacterOntoBothRecords
D $EAF8 Copies the character being processed onto the two records and gives both the location #N$32.
. Reached from the script command at #R$EA5F, run by #R$CC82.
. Run by #R$CA64 after the display record at #R$EAF6. A non-zero return means the script step succeeded.
  $EAF8,$03 Read the room display parameter.
  $EAFB,$07 Store that id at offset #N$01 of the record at #R$A015.
  $EB02,$04 Give that record the location #N$32.
  $EB06,$08 Give the record at #R$A013 the location #N$32.
  $EB0E,$02,b$01 Reset the zero flag.
  $EB10,$01 Return.

b $EB11 Display Record
D $EB11 Display record read by #R$C9BF. The show-message commands at #R$EA31 and #R$EA43 pass
. this word to #R$C591.
N $EB11 Named from the script commands at #R$EA31 and #R$EA43.
B $EB11,$02 Display record read by #R$C9BF: flags #N$00, value #N$00.

c $EB13 Point At The First Character
@ $EB13 label=CopyCharacterOntoBothRecords_ActionFlags
D $EB13 Points at the character record at #R$99A9 and joins the flag test.
N $EB13 Run by #R$CA64 after the display record at #R$EB11, from the show-message commands at #R$EA31 and
. #R$EA43.
  $EB13,$04 Point at the character record at #R$99A9.
  $EB17,$02 Go to #R$EB1F to test bit 1 of the action flags.

b $EB19 Display Record
D $EB19 Display record read by #R$C9BF. The show-message command at #R$EA2C passes this word to
. #R$C591.
N $EB19 Named from the script command at #R$EA2C.
B $EB19,$02 Display record read by #R$C9BF: flags #N$00, value #N$00.

c $EB1B Point At The Other Character
@ $EB1B label=CopyCharacterOntoBothRecords_OtherRecord
D $EB1B Points at the character record at #R$9997 and tests bit 1 of its action flags. A non-zero return means the script step succeeded.
N $EB1B Run by #R$CA64 after the display record at #R$EB19, from the show-message command at #R$EA2C.
  $EB1B,$04 Point at the character record at #R$9997.
@ $EB1F label=CopyCharacterOntoBothRecords_TestActionBit
  $EB1F,$04 Clear the pointer and the carry.
  $EB23,$04 See whether bit 1 of the action flags is set.
  $EB27,$01 Return.
