c $ED3B Set Bit Six Of The Current Object
@ $ED3B label=SetCurrentObjectBitSix
D $ED3B Sets bit 6 of the current object's flags.
N $ED3B Run by #R$CA64 after the display record at #R$ED39, from the show-message command at #R$ECBB.
  $ED3B,$03 Take #N$050B as the source address.
  $ED3E,$03 Take #R$6929+#N$0441 as the message.
  $ED41,$02 Take a count of #N$10.
  $ED43,$03 Call #R$F1B2 to update object #N$0B.
  $ED46,$04 Set bit 6 of the current object's flags.
  $ED4A,$01 Return.
